        "original_id": "f9d3d578-e6b6-58f5-82b8-4199cb761530",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Vienna, Bohemia\n- Organizations: Flex, Waves Vienna\n- People: High Contrast, Lincoln Barrett, Emilie Bach\n- Topics: Drum and bass DJs, electronic music\n\nFacts:\n- Emilie Bach was born as Emilie Neuschloss in Bohemia on July 2, 1840.\n- Emilie Bach was an artist and journalist, and she died in Vienna on April 29, 1890.\n- High Contrast is the stage name of Lincoln Barrett, who was born on September 18, 1979.\n- Lincoln Barrett, known as High Contrast, is a Welsh electronic music producer, DJ, and record producer.\n- Flex is a nightclub in Vienna.\n- Flex has hosted hundreds of visits from drum and bass DJs including Pendulum, High Contrast, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, and Leopoi.\n- Waves Vienna takes place across a series of music venues in Vienna, including Fluc, Flex, and Odeon.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
