        "original_id": "10259a33-8756-5fb7-ae0c-7b57d370dd1c",
        "text": "Page: Flex (club). Sentence: Flex is a nightclub in Vienna.\nPage: Flex (club). Sentence: There have been hundreds of visits from drum and bass DJs like: Pendulum, High Contrast, DJ Marky, Aphrodite, Patifee, DJ Hype, Logistics, Leopoi, and others.\nPage: High Contrast. Sentence: Lincoln Barrett, better known by the stage name High Contrast (born 18 September 1979), is a Welsh electronic music producer DJ and record producer.\nPage: Waves Vienna. Sentence: The festival takes place in a series of music venues in Vienna such as the Fluc, Flex and Odeon.\nPage: Emilie Bach. Sentence: Emilie Bach (born Neuschloss, Bohemia, July 2, 1840; died Vienna April 29, 1890) was an artist and journalist.",
